#
# A real Oracle server response to a UROWID column fetch that ends in
# ORA-01403 (no data found), captured as `hexdump -C` output. Reused from the
# go-ora driver's urowid test buffer (MIT, Copyright 2020 Samy Sultan) as a
# capture fact — a single TNS_DATA packet (length 0x193). The offset column and
# the trailing |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
